<title>JAPAN: Misawa Resort -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Misawa Resort -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 17.35		vs	   18.38</p>
<p> Operating	  434    million	  vs	  562    million</p>
<p> Current	    403    million	  vs	  471    million</p>
<p> Net		  202    million	  vs	  168    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.36 yen	  vs	    7.41 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     27 million	  vs	  25 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Misawa Resort Co Ltd is a comprehensive leisure company affiliated with Misawa Homes Co Ltd.</p>
